WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.680
I got basically no sleep last night!

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:02.680
Good morning.

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:03.440
Really?

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.430
G-Good morning, Senpai!

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:06.730
Morning.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:08.300
Oh, Fudo.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.610
Here, it's addressed to you.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.520
You can tell, right? I've got 
major bags under my eyes.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.360
I can see them!

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.450
It's so important to get 
proper sleep at night.

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:20.970
Senpai?

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.540
What's up? You look like you've seen a ghost.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.620
N-N-Nothing!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:34.010
<b>I know everything</b>

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.770
<i>Desumi-san, we've got a problem.</i>

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:07.980
Episode 8     Everybody Has a Secret or Two

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:09.230
You're so awesome, Desumi.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:11.610
You always make your own lunches?

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.740
It's not so hard once you get used to it.

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:15.430
Really?

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:27.070
Sorry, Desucchi. Mouth slipped.

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:29.150
Are you all right, Desumi?

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:30.230
<b>Rattled...</b>

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:32.520
W-Well... I'm pretty used to it by now...

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.120
That makes it even worse!

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:39.680
<b>Terror</b>

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:38.090
What? You got a problem?

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:39.680
No...

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.010
You bet we got a problem.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.910
You're always pickin' on Reaper—

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:48.950
on Desumi Magahara.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.730
Sounds like someone needs a little 
help learning right from wrong.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.070
Student council president!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.610
Discipline officer!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:03:05.120
<b>Beast Princess, A.K.A.
Kiki Majima</b>

00:02:54.610 --> 00:03:05.120
<b>Steel Princess, A.K.A.
Kyoko Kuroyuri</b>

00:02:54.610 --> 00:03:05.120
<b>Reaper Princess, A.K.A.
Desumi Magahara</b>

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.990
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.670
<i>On Gekko's orders,</i>

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:02.350
<i>the Princess Series, 
including Reaper Princess,</i>

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:05.120
<i>all attend the same school!</i>

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:08.310
And why don't you ever stand up for yourself?

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:10.430
Give as good as you get once in a while.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:13.930
Well, it's just a rice ball. No big deal.

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.810
Really? It's not?

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:19.380
Knock it off! You're gonna 
make everything worse!

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:22.840
Well, anyway...

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.600
Hojo of Class 2-B.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:28.260
Your skirt length, nails, earrings, 
and just about everything else

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:29.350
are in violation of school rules!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.840
Come to the guidance office later!

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:32.810
Meh, sounds dumb.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.240
You guys must be starved 
for romantic attention.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:36.950
Am not!

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:38.070
<b>No attention</b>

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:40.690
When it comes to rice 
balls or anything else...

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:45.410
I get what I want, no matter what it takes.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:51.430
And right now, what I want most is...

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.870
What do you think?

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.370
Well...

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.590
It's a secret.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.660
You don't get to know, Desucchi.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.340
What's her problem?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.150
What kind of loser keeps secrets, anyway?

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:10.790
Now, now. Everybody has a secret or two.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:11.820
What?!

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:15.400
It's that happy-go-lucky attitude 
that makes you a target, y'know!

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:23.700
If you don't want me to make this picture public,
come to Central Park tomorrow at 8 PM

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.550
Hey!

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:34.150
You really came, huh? Hilarious.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:38.410
A-Are you the one who sent me this?

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.900
Correct.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.300
I'm the one who took that picture.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:48.260
Red Gelato... Fudo Aikawa.

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:51.190
Why in the world are you doing this?

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.490
Who exactly are you?

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:56.620
You really think I'm gonna give up my name?

00:04:56.620 --> 00:05:01.780
You've probably guessed by now, but I can 
send out that picture anytime I want.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.530
That'd be a problem for you, right?

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.990
Yes, it would be.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:12.210
So you're just gonna have 
to do whatever I say.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:16.620
Whether you play along or not will decide 
if the picture stays private or—

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.330
P-Please!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.130
Uh?

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:24.030
Promise that when you publish the picture, 
you'll put a censorship bar over her eyes!

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:24.570
What?

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:25.760
I'm begging you!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.450
<i>That's</i> the problem?

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.840
You're okay with it going public otherwise?

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.140
Absolutely!

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:32.740
That doesn't make sense.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:33.970
Your reputation—

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.850
I don't care about my reputation!

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:40.670
But... I really don't want 
to make any trouble for her.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.480
And...

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.890
If the picture were to go out uncensored,

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:50.240
she would quickly go viral 
as an angel on earth!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.950
Plus, agents would be falling all 
over themselves to recruit her!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.350
Idol! Model! Actress!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:57.940
She'll get all kinds of offers,

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:01.500
and before I know it, she'll have 
ascended far beyond my reach!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.350
It's too terrifying to conceive!

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:05.880
You're a creepy little man.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:07.990
Well, fine.

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:11.140
One way or another, you don't 
want me leaking it, right?

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:15.870
Which means you've gotta 
do whatever I tell you.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.050
Got it?

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.890
Y-Yes...

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.180
Then you'd better break up with her—

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:21.650
I will not!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:22.540
Hey!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:31.160
<b>Squeeze</b>

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:25.160
Since when do you get a 
choice in the whole thing?!

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:27.650
Don't you get what's going on here?

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:31.160
B-But I'd really appreciate 
it if you wouldn't go there!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.700
Would you accept an alternative?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.800
Alternative?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.120
Well...

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:39.000
Okay.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.580
<b>Record</b>

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.130
<b>Recording</b>

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.720
Then, tell me you love me!

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.630
I will not!

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.130
Have a little tact, jerk!

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:52.240
Fine. I'm gonna call the tabloids.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.310
Wait!

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.390
What exactly are you after here?

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:59.640
Are you trying to come between us?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.570
Oh, shut up.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:08.040
Listen up... here's your last chance.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:13.280
K-Kiss my hand!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.590
I'll get a picture of you groveling,

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:22.460
and make our master-slave relationship clear.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.980
Is this the kind of thing 
you called me out for?

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.110
Just do it already!

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.150
Master-slave relationship?

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.260
I...

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:57.240
I can't do it!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.380
It's freaking humiliating!

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.370
Huh?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.950
Fine, I'll let you off with a warning!

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.300
But tomorrow, I'm gonna think of way 
more disgusting things for you to do!

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.250
You'd better be ready!

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.500
And if you don't come, 
that picture goes everywhere!

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.910
You big, stupid jerk!

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:14.620
Huh?

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.270
And that's what happened, Desumi-san.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.020
Who in the world is she?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:30.470
Well, she didn't give her name, 
so I don't know who she is...

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:32.240
But I'm set to meet her again tonight.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.880
I'll just have to silence her permanently.

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:37.910
Please don't go right to those thoughts!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:42.250
What exactly did she try to get you to do?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.880
Oh, well...

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.290
She wanted me to kiss her hand—

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:49.090
But I didn't!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.620
Y-You really didn't?

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:52.920
I didn't.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.520
I'm sorry. Are you okay?

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:56.930
I'm fine.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:08:59.820
A-Anything else?

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:01.930
She wanted me to say I love her.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.180
She even asked me to break up with you.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:11.880
I haven't the foggiest 
idea what she's thinking.

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:15.890
Desumi-san?

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:17.910
Fudo...

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.660
I think she's...

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.370
in love.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:26.000
In love? With whom?

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.070
<i>You're not saying...</i>

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.410
<i>She's in love with me?!</i>

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.230
It's all right, Desumi-san.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:54.990
There's nothing to worry about.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.280
<i>I feel bad for the girl,</i>

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.820
<i>but I need to make things clear to her.</i>

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:15.300
Good boy. You actually came!

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:20.300
I'm sorry, girl whose name I don't know!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:25.810
I thought it over, and realized how you feel.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.230
I truly appreciate the 
feelings you have for me.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:31.800
What?

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.340
I acted truly shameful yesterday.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.870
Wait—

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:38.240
But I cannot return your feelings—

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:36.700
Stop—

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:37.640
Stop—

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:38.240
S...

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.180
Stop!

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.990
What in the world are you talking about?!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.910
But you're in love, aren't you?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:45.490
What?!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.250
With me?

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.750
Heck no! I'm in love with <i>Desucchi</i>!

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:54.500
Crap! I said it out loud!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.220
Wow, she's so tacky.

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.570
Bet she's easy.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:10:59.850
She's kinda scary.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.640
She'd blow her top over nothing.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:03.510
Better stay away.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.980
Oh, wow! I love your nails!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.950
Oh, sorry to ambush you.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:18.490
But I always want to do mine that way,
 and it never turns out right!

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:22.110
Oh... yeah?

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.670
I'm Desumi Magahara.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:25.870
Nice to meet you!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:37.570
Desucchi was so honest and innocent. 
I've had a huge crush on her ever since.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.290
<i>No reaction, huh?</i>

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:49.790
Sorry to besmirch your pure little 
Desucchi with my unworthy feelings!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.640
Nothing to be sorry for!

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.440
I was just thinking, you have
 incredibly good taste!

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:59.060
I'm so glad to meet someone else 
who sees how amazing she is!

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:01.190
I know!

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:04.260
Want to stay up all night and 
talk about how great she is?!

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:08.990
Well?

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.950
You're so weird.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.750
Talking sounds fun, but I'll pass for now.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:21.880
We're still kinda like rivals, you know?

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.470
Hey, Red Gelato...

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.010
No, Fudocchi.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.850
"Fudocchi"?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.560
Sorry about all the trouble I made.

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:36.910
I'm probably gonna keep 
making trouble, just FYI.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:38.520
R-Right...

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:42.460
I'm kind of self-centered, 
I'm a little perverse...

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:43.580
And...

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.100
I just never know when to quit.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:53.650
Besides, Desucchi and 
I have a secret connection.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:59.810
My own little secret that 
even Desucchi doesn't know.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:04.030
Better keep your guard up, 
or I'll steal her from you!

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:05.570
See ya!

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:08.110
A secret?

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:15.440
A meeting this early in 
the morning? I've got the worst luck.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.620
The early bird gets the worm, Beast-san.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.690
Don't lecture me when <i>I'm</i> the 
one who had to wake <i>you</i> up.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:22.710
Sheesh...

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.270
Hey, Heat.

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:39.710
What's up with her? Learn some
 basic manners already.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.820
Don't say that, Beast.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:45.690
No one's ever seen her face or 
heard her real voice, right?

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:47.470
I don't trust her.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.260
I think it's just fine.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.180
Everybody has a secret or two.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.620
Oh? Does that mean you're 
hiding something, Reaper?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.810
What? O-Of course not!

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:07.110
<i>My own little secret that 
even Desucchi doesn't know.</i>

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.450
Desucchi is as adorable as ever!

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:19.000
<b>Gekko Princess Series
Heat Princess
Anna Hojo</b>

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:21.980
Love After World Domination!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.880
I'm so nervous!

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:35.480
It's all right, Desumi-san.

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:36.970
Believe in us!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:43.400
<i>Your compatibility rating is 98%!</i>

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.110
Isn't that great, Fudo—

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.860
Why do you look so unhappy?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.110
It wasn't 100%...

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:53.490
You're so hard on yourself.

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:55.950
Excuse me, could I drop in?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.340
What is it, Haru?

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.430
Desumi-san.

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:04.120
Does Gekko have any attack plans tomorrow?

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.830
This is off the record, okay?

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:09.380
Bosslar-sama won't be in tomorrow, 
so all attacks are off!

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.240
Awesome!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:13.210
So, Fudo-senpai,

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.260
can you help me study tomorrow?

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:18.900
Finals are coming up, 
and I haven't done any test prep!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.770
Sure, that's fine.

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:24.020
Wait, Fudo, are you a really good student?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:28.040
Despite how he looks, Senpai is 
always in the top ten for his year!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.100
<i>Despite</i> how he looks!

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:31.090
That's awesome!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.030
<i>How exactly do I look?</i>

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.030
How exactly
do I look?

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:33.420
Very well!

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.730
We'll have a study hangout tomorrow.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.160
Thank you!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:49.050
Are you bad at school too, Desumi-san?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.800
Y-Yes...

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:53.340
Then let's make it a threesome!

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:58.130
But if we do that, we won't 
be able to do it at HQ...

00:15:58.130 --> 00:15:59.890
Let's do it at my place, then!

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:03.510
What?

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.780
<b>Gekko</b>

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.780
<b>The
Next
Day</b>

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.780
Desumi-san... is this...

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.690
The Gekko women's dormitory!

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:13.020
That's what I thought!

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:15.860
Come on, this is way too dangerous!

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:16.490
Right, Senpai?

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:21.910
<b>Walking on air</b>

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:21.910
<i>Desumi-san's room. Desumi-san's room. 
Desumi-san's room. Desumi-san's room...</i>

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:20.840
<i>Never mind. He's already walking on air.</i>

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:23.970
Don't worry, Haru.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.700
Just put this on, and you'll be fine!

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.460
You really think it'll be that easy?

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.610
You have it on backwards!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.640
I'm so scared...

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:37.790
What's the password?

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:38.720
Briar rose!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.910
You may pass!

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:47.370
Kii!

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:49.230
K-Kii!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.270
Okay, we're here!

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:53.370
<i>Shouldn't your security be 
a little tighter than this?</i>

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:02.270
Desumi-san, your room is so cute!

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.660
At last...

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.940
At last, I have reached the promised land!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:13.950
The holy ground I previously 
only saw in video calls!

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.620
It smells like Desumi-san!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.760
Never mind the studying, let's—

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.770
Sorry, I lost control there.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:31.680
Let's begin studying.

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:39.530
Fudo-sensei, thank you for the lesson!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:40.830
Thank you both for coming!

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.290
<b>Math II</b>

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.030
<b>Year 2  Term 2  Midterm  Answer Sheet
</b> 2-A Desumi Magahara

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.030
All perfect scores!

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.190
Hang on! You're awesome at school!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:55.170
What's going on here, Desumi-san?

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.950
Did you just want to study with us?

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.700
Y-Yes...

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:04.810
<i>Oh so cute!</i>

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:04.810
<b>Oh so cute</b>

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.560
So I'm the only hopeless one here?

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.900
As charming as this is, rules are rules.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:13.110
Very well. Go on and do it!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:14.300
<i>Thwap.</i>

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.070
<b>Thwap</b>

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.790
I got a strike for lying.

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.110
<i>So cute!</i>

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:24.700
I'm sorry for lying to you about 
being bad at school, Haru.

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:28.180
<b>Shame...</b>

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.540
I'm actually very good at school!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:30.080
That apology wasn't great.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.960
Then let's try again!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.810
We'll both teach you!

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.890
Yeah! I'm gonna learn so much!

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.210
That's not the way, now.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.560
That's not going to get you to the answer.

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:56.980
Imagine that the value of 
X is the bicep brachii.

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:00.260
What does that make Y?

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:03.950
I don't know.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.600
The forearm flexors, of course!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:11.130
Now solve the next problem, 
supposing that X is your deltoid.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:12.750
I can't solve it—

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.170
Bear in mind its connection 
to the pectoralis major!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.920
If you can't sort it out, drawing out
 the anatomy might help.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.680
Drawing the anatomy?!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.460
Yes! That should do it!

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:25.570
<i>Crap!</i>

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:27.840
<i>I read so much BL, I actually did it!</i>

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:32.030
The connection between math 
and muscles is inseparable.

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.170
Everything makes more sense when you liken

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:37.260
the beauty of solving equations 
to well-strengthened muscles.

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:36.590
Help me, Desumi-san!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:40.130
Just as muscles connect in a 
beautiful way, the numbers—

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.780
Hey, come on. You're just confusing her.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.460
Let me teach her.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.230
Don't overthink it!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:50.550
All you need for math problems is spirit!

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:53.750
Just fill in that formula, wham!

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.410
Which formula, exactly?

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:02.820
You know, the wobbly one!

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:05.170
With the smooth lines in it.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:10.700
Then give it a wha-chock and the 
answer will come out like <i>yeah</i>!

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.090
<i>Ah.</i>

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.490
Liken it to the parallel curves 
of the trapezius and the deltoids!

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.850
<i>They're awful teachers.</i>

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.330
Just wham those numbers 
down in front of you,

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:14.180
Understanding muscles will deepen 
your understanding of math!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.180
and don't be afraid to smack that 
formula in there right after!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:16.470
Timing is important there.

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:17.280
Similarly, understanding muscles 
means understanding math!

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:18.310
Sometimes they get you on your heels,

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:18.310
There's nothing else to it!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:20.770
but just make sure to stay flexible 
and they'll tap out eventually,

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:22.890
Additionally, likening unequal equations 
to the biceps femoris is quite famous—

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.610
Um...

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:22.360
so pay close attention to—

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.690
I should probably go.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:26.070
You've got it down already?

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:28.170
Haru's such a quick learner!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:30.660
We must be great teachers!

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.200
I really envy you two.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.590
You'll have your choice of university.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.460
University?

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:44.490
I've gotta work hard to 
get into my first choice!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:41.840
<b>Hmph</b>

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:46.470
Happy to help anytime. Just ask.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.490
Thanks for everything.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.730
I'll be going now.

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:54.750
Sure thing. See you again!

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:12.060
<i>Alone with Desumi-san in her room...</i>

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.030
<i>I suddenly feel so nervous.</i>

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.440
What's wrong?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.300
You look strangely serious.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.870
Sorry.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:25.090
I was just thinking about what Haru said.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:32.610
Fudo, are you moving on to 
university after high school?

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:33.460
Yes.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.370
I want to study education.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:43.300
And someday, I want to become an elementary 
school teacher and teach children.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:47.310
I want to be a hero-slash-teacher.

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.450
Desumi-san, do you have 
a goal for the future?

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:57.590
I...

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:02.070
I want to go to the same university you do.

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:06.670
I want a front-row seat to you 
making your dream come true.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:11.010
That's a goal I just came up with.

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.010
Desumi-san...

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:19.150
But I think my father would 
probably be really against it.

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:24.650
I think he expects me to go full-time 
with Gekko after I graduate high school.

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:31.010
Hey, if it comes to that, 
I'll convince your father!

00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:33.940
I can always count on you!

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:40.050
I hope we can go together, Fudo.

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:42.210
I know we will.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.510
Even someone like me can become a hero.

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:47.660
There's no goal that can't be reached.

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:49.410
Yeah.

00:22:56.650 --> 00:22:58.970
Oh, I bet that's Haru.

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:01.340
Maybe she forgot something!

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>Desumi-sensei!</i>

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:10.350
<i>It's your daddy!</i>

00:23:10.350 --> 00:23:12.940
<i>Came to see ya in person for once!</i>

00:23:12.940 --> 00:23:15.140
<i>I brought torimon, too!</i>

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:17.410
This is... not good.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:19.060
<i>Open up already!</i>

00:23:20.810 --> 00:23:21.750
Desumi-san!

00:23:22.510 --> 00:23:23.250
Hey.

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:24.880
Desumi-san!

00:23:25.410 --> 00:23:26.880
Are you listening?

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.860
Desumi-san!

00:23:28.860 --> 00:23:29.830
Shut up!

00:23:32.690 --> 00:23:37.140
Next episode is, "My Big Sister Has Changed."

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 9    My Big Sister Has Changed

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:38.600
Get it now?

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:39.300
Yes.
